Find is the default mode; Enter in Ask mode runs the question, Enter in Find just keeps filtering (debounced, cancel-and-replace). The seven scopes are the single-select `segmented-control` above (WP-N3 08-11 — the Tasks/Apps list-view idiom, no new block kind): one group, exactly one selected item, active item accent-filled. The per-chip verbs (`scopeEverything` … `scopeDevices`) consolidate into `setSearchScope`, which emits the selected scope key.

### Scope pre-selection map

The raising surface pre-selects its own chip:

| Raised from | Pre-selected chip |
|-------------|-------------------|
| Docs / doc detail | Docs |
| Tasks / task detail | Tasks |
| Apps / app detail / code | Apps |
| Messages | Messages |
| Files | Files |
| Devices | Devices |
| Anywhere else (hub, Posts, settings, Surfy panel) | Everything |

## State 2 — Everything recents

Switching the chip re-filters the Recents live. Under Everything, ALL recent kinds show — including Posts-kind recents, which have no chip of their own among the seven and surface only here.

