## State 3 — Find results

One federated query; hits filter to the active scope, group under uppercase kind labels in a fixed kind order, cap at ~14 rows, ellipsized single-line titles. A hit routes and the sheet closes. Query "tidepool" under Everything:

::toolbar
- text[value="DOCS"]
::

::row[icon=doc action=openSearchHit href=#]
tidepool — Spec
Routes to the doc detail
::

::toolbar
- text[value="APPS"]
::

::row[icon=sparkle action=openSearchHit href=#]
tidepool
Routes to the app detail
::

## State 4 — Find no-match

No matches for "laguna".

## State 5 — Ask idle

Segmented-control on Ask, no query; the scope strip stays put (Ask is workspace-grounded regardless of chip).

::segmented-control[name=search-mode-ask action=setSearchMode active=ask size=compact]
- find "Find"
- ask "Ask Surfy"
::

Ask a question — Surfy answers from your workspace with sources.

## State 6 — Ask answered

Enter runs the question: Working… interim, then the streamed grounded answer rendered STATIC here (streaming is state layer), a Sources group, then Continue in Surfy (seeds the panel composer with the question, never auto-sends).

Based on the workspace: the Android lane's next gate is the v3 AAB upload and the passkey smoke — Batch 4 billing is built and waiting on it. The deploy worker (mini) is idle with 0 jobs queued.

::toolbar
- text[value="SOURCES"]
::

::row[icon=task action=openSearchSource href=#]
