Routes to the task detail
::

::row[icon=file action=openSearchSource href=#]
mini — deploy worker
Routes to Devices
::

::toolbar
- button[label="Continue in Surfy" action=seedSurfy]
::

## Renderer notes (consciously deferred)

- The wrapper renders the sheet body as a 640px centered column in the main pane; shipped is the centered modal floated OVER the raising surface (`modals/search.surf` owns the frame, Esc dismisses, top-right ✕ per dismiss canon) — overlay composition is not expressible in the static engine.
- The seven scopes render as the single-row `segmented-control` block (WP-N3 08-11 — the `toggled=` toolbar-button stand-in is gone); shipped is a WRAPPING single-select pill strip, active chip accent-filled. The wrap behaviour — and any `::suggestion-chips` single-select treatment — stays deferred to the block round; at narrow widths the segmented group overflow-scrolls rather than wraps.
- Autofocus on open, the debounce + cancel-and-replace, live re-filtering of Recents, and the Ask streaming/Working… interim are state layer, not vocabulary.
- The uppercase kind labels (RECENT, DOCS, APPS, SOURCES) render as toolbar text rows — the group-head stand-in, deferred with the stage-group-head treatment.
